   * | value                                       | result     |
   * |---------------------------------------------|------------|
   * | '5.5'                                       | string     |
   * | [1, 2.5, 3]                                 | json       |
   * | JS object: {"name": "foo"}                  | json       |
   * | Py dict/JS Map: new Map([['mumble', 55.66]])| null       |
